{"batchcomplete":"","query":{"pages":{"1390":{"pageid":1390,"ns":0,"title":"Buffs","revisions":[{"revid":56034,"parentid":55671,"slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","*":"{{Sequel Disambiguation|1}}{{Ambox|title=WARNING| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" ||color=red|icon=GremlinNob.png|message=''This page is under construction. Information may be wrong or incomplete.''}}{{#setmainimage:Intent_Buff.png|quiet}}\n{{TOC limit|2}}\nSee also: [[Debuffs]]\n\n== Stack Types ==\n{{Hatnote|'''Note:''' These terms are not officially used by the game and are used by the wiki for better classification and description of their behavior.}}\n* '''Intensity buffs''' are more effective depending on how many stacks of the buff are applied. These buffs typically are either permanent for the combat encounter or are consumed on the following turn.\n* '''Duration buffs''' last for as many turns as there are stacks of the buff. At the end of the turn, the buff will decrement by one stack.\n* '''Counter buffs''' activate when an event happens, such as taking damage or being inflicted with a debuff. With the exception of {{BD|Mantra}}, counter buffs lose a stack each time they activate.\n* Buffs that do not stack are typically gained from Power cards and last the entire combat encounter.\n\n{{BD|Regen}} is the ONLY buff with both '''Intensity''' and '''Duration''' stack types.\n\n== Buffs ==\nCharacters may obtain buffs they may not normally cannot access by means of {{R|Prismatic Shard}} if it is obtained from a card.\n\n<div id=\"character-filters\"></div>\n{| class=\"wikitable sortable\" id=\"characterTable\" data-roster=\"sts1\" data-filter-label=\"Obtainable By\" data-summary-label=\"Any Character\"\n! Icon\n! style=\"width: 8em;\" | Name\n! style=\"width: 20em;\" | Source\n! Description\n! Notes\n! Stacking Type\n! Caps at\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Strength.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''[[Strength]]'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Inflame}} {{C|Flex}} {{C|Rupture}} {{C|Spot Weakness}} {{C|Demon Form}} {{R|Red Skull}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Reprogram}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Fasting}} {{C|Wish}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|J.A.X.}} {{R|Du-Vu Doll}} {{R|Girya}} {{R|Shuriken}} {{R|Vajra}} {{P|Strength Potion}} {{P|Flex Potion}} {{P|Cultist Potion}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Cultist}} {{M|Fungi Beast}} {{M|Jaw Worm}} {{M|Red Louse}} {{M|Mad Gremlin}} {{M|Gremlin Nob}} {{M|Hexaghost}} {{M|Byrd}} {{M|Chosen}} {{M|Mystic}} {{M|Bronze Automaton}} {{M|The Champ}} {{M|The Collector}} {{M|Orb Walker}} {{M|The Maw}} {{M|Awakened One}} {{M|Donu}} and {{M|Deca}} {{M|Time Eater}} {{M|Spire Spear}} {{M|Corrupt Heart}} [[Elites#Super_Elites|Super Elites]]</span>\n| Increases (Decreases) attack damage by X.\n| <span data-text=\"ironclad\">Negative {{BD|Strength}} will be multiplied by {{C|Limit Break}}.</span>\n| Intensity\n| -999 to 999\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon Dexterity.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''[[Dexterity]]'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Footwork}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Reprogram}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Fasting}} {{R|Duality}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{R|Kunai}} {{R|Oddly Smooth Stone}} {{P|Dexterity Potion}} {{P|Speed Potion}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Increases (Decreases) {{KW|Block}} gained from cards by X.\n|\n| Intensity\n| -999 to 999\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Artifact.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''[[Artifact]]'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Core Surge}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|Panacea}} {{R|Clockwork Souvenir}} {{P|Ancient Potion}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Sentry}} {{M|Spheric Guardian}} {{M|Bronze Automaton}} {{M|Donu}} and {{M|Deca}} {{M|Corrupt Heart}} {{R|Ancient Augmentation}}</span>\n| Negates X debuffs.\n| \n* Negates the next debuff on that unit. Each stack will negate 1 application.<br>\n* Effects that apply multiple Debuffs will do so in the order listed in the card. For example if the enemy has 1 {{BD|Artifact}}, {{C|Shockwave}} will first attempt to apply {{BD|Weak}} and remove the {{BD|Artifact}} charge, and then will successfully apply the {{BD|Vulnerable}}.\n| Counter\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon Buffer.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Buffer'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Buffer}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{R|Fossilized Helix}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Prevent the next X times you would lose HP.\n|\n| Counter\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon Intangible.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Intangible'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Wraith Form}} {{P|Ghost in a Jar}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|Apparition}} {{R|Incense Burner}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Nemesis}} {{R|Hauntings}}</span>\n| Reduce ALL damage and HP loss take to 1 for X turns.\n|\n| Duration\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon PlatedArmor.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''[[Plated Armor]]'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Wish}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{R|Thread and Needle}} {{P|Essence of Steel}} {{KW|Terminal}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Shelled Parasite}} {{M|Donu}} and {{M|Deca}}{{Asc|19}} {{R|Ancient Augmentation}}</span>\n| At the end of your/its turn, gain X {{KW|Block}}. Receiving unblocked attack damage reduces {{BD|Plated Armor}} by 1.\n|\n| Intensity\n| 0 to 999\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon Thorns.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Thorns'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Caltrops}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{R|Bronze Scales}} {{P|Liquid Bronze}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Spiker}}</span>\n| When attacked, deals X damage back.\n| \n* Similar functionality to {{M|The Guardian}}'s {{BD|Sharp Hide}} buff. However, {{BD|Sharp Hide}} only deals damage after you play an Attack instead of dealing damage on each hit.\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon Vigor.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Vigor'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Wreath of Flame}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{R|Akabeko}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Your next Attack deals X additional damage.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_DoubleTap.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Duplication'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{P|Duplication Potion}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Your next X cards are played twice.\n|\n| Counter\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_PenNib.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Pen Nib'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{R|Pen Nib}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Your next {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Attack|Attack}} deals double damage.\n| If {{R|Pen Nib}} is obtained before {{R|Red Skull}}, instead of the usual order of operation, the 2\u00d7 applies first and then the +3 {{BD|Strength}}.\n| Does not stack\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Regen.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Regen'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{P|Regen Potion}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the end of your turn, heal X HP and reduce {{BD|Regen}} by 1.\n| Internally called Regeneration.\n| Intensity and Duration\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon Ritual.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Ritual'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{P|Cultist Potion}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Cultist}}</span>\n| At the end of your/its turn, gain X {{BD|Strength}}.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon DrawCard.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Draw Card'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Predator}} {{C|Doppelganger}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Simmering Fury}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Draw X additional cards next turn.\n| \n* Can only be obtained by [[Silent]] and [[Watcher]].\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| <span data-text=\"silent\">[[File:Icon EnergizedGreen.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]</span><span data-text=\"defect\">[[File:Icon EnergizedBlue.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]</span>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Energized'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Doppelganger}} {{C|Flying Knee}} {{C|Outmaneuver}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Charge Battery}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Gain X additional <span data-energy=\"silent\">{{Icon|GE}}</span><span data-energy=\"defect\">{{Icon|BE}}</span><span data-energy=\"all\">{{Icon|CE}}</span> next turn.\n| \n* Can only be obtained by [[Silent]] and [[Defect]].\n* Both types of Energized count as different buffs.\n| Intensity\n| -999 to 999\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon Focus.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''[[Focus]]'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Biased Cognition}} {{C|Consume}} {{C|Defragment}} {{R|Data Disk}} {{P|Focus Potion}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Increases (Decreases) the effectiveness of your [[Orbs]] by X.\n| \n* Exclusive to [[Defect]].\n* {{KW|Dark}} Orbs gain more Evoke damage per turn with {{BD|Focus}}.\n* {{KW|Plasma}} Orbs are unaffected by {{BD|Focus}}.\n| Intensity\n| -999 to 999\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon Mantra.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Mantra'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Prostrate}} {{C|Devotion}} {{C|Worship}} {{C|Pray}} {{R|Damaru}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you gain 10 {{BD|Mantra}}, enter {{KW|Divinity}}.\n| \n* Exclusive to [[Watcher]].\n* If a player gains more than 10 {{BD|Mantra}} at a single instance (only possible by 10+ stacks of {{C|Devotion}} in vanilla gameplay), none of it counts towards {{C|Brilliance}}'s damage increase.<br>\n* Up to 9 {{BD|Mantra}} stacks will carry over after the player enters {{KW|Divinity}}, so if more than 10 is gained at once, the extra {{BD|Mantra}} is wasted.\n| Counter\n| Integer limit for {{C|Brilliance}}, but resets at 10 for the purpose of {{KW|Divinity}}\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon Barricade.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Barricade'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Barricade}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Spheric Guardian}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| {{KW|Block}} is not removed at the start of your/its turn.\n|\n| Does not stack\n| 1\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Berserk.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Berserk'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Berserk}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, gain X {{Icon|RE}}.\n| Will show up as {{Icon|RE}}Energy on the tooltip, no matter the character.\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit, but you only gain up to 999 Energy.\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Brutality.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Brutality'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Brutality}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, lose X HP and draw X cards.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit, but will not draw more than hand size\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Combust.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Combust'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Combust}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the end of your turn, lose N HP and deal X damage to ALL enemies.\n| N = 1 HP for each Combust played\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Corruption.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Corruption'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Corruption}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Skill|Skills}} cost 0. Whenever you play a {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Skill|Skill}}, {{KW|Exhaust}} it.\n| \n* Overrides {{R|Snecko Eye}}'s {{BD|Confused}} and {{P|Snecko Oil}}'s cost randomization.<br>\n* Can rarely have a bug where Skills don't cost 0 and cannot be played if the player doesn't have energy for it (visual; resets after a non-Power is played).\n| Does not stack\n| n/a\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_DarkEmbrace.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Dark Embrace'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Dark Embrace}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever a card is {{KW|Exhaust|Exhausted}}, draw X cards.\n| With {{R|Dead Branch}}, when any action exhausts multiple cards at the same time, it resolves 1 card at a time (generate then draw, per card).\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit, but will not draw more than hand size\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_DemonForm.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Demon Form'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Demon Form}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, gain X {{BD|Strength}}.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit, but will not gain more than 999 {{BD|Strength}}\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_DoubleTap.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Double Tap'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Double Tap}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Your next X Attacks are played twice.\n|\n| Counter\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Evolve.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Evolve'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Evolve}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you draw a Status, draw X cards.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_FeelNoPain.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Feel No Pain'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Feel No Pain}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever a card is Exhausted, gain X {{KW|Block}}.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_FireBreathing.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Fire Breathing'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Fire Breathing}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you draw a Status or Curse card, deal X damage to ALL enemies.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_FlameBarrier.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Flame Barrier'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Flame Barrier}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| When attacked, deals X damage back. Wears off at the start of your next turn.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Juggernaut.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Juggernaut'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Juggernaut}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you gain {{KW|Block}}, deal X damage to a random enemy.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon Metallicize.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Metallicize'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Metallicize}} {{P|Heart of Iron}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Lagavulin}} {{M|The Champ}} Burning Elites</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the end of your/its turn, gain X {{KW|Block}}.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Anger.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Rage'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Rage}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you play an Attack, gain X {{KW|Block}}.\n| Is unaffected by {{C|Dexterity}}; works through No Block from {{C|Panic Button}}.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Rupture.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Rupture'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Rupture}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you lose HP from a card, gain X {{BD|Strength}}.\n| Will not trigger if you take 0 real damage (reduced by {{R|Tungsten Rod}} or negated by {{BD|Buffer}}).\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Accuracy.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Accuracy'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Accuracy}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| {{C|Shiv|Shivs}} deal X additional damage.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_AfterImage.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''After Image'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|After Image}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you play a card, gain X {{KW|Block}}.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Blur.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Blur'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Blur}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| {{KW|Block}} is not removed at the start of your next X turns.\n|\n| Duration\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Burst.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Burst'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Burst}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Your next X Skills are played twice this turn.\n|\n| Counter\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_DoubleDamage.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Double Damage'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Phantasmal Killer}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Attacks deal double damage for X turns.\n|\n| Duration\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Envenom.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Envenom'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Envenom}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you deal unblocked attack damage, apply X {{BD|Poison}}.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_InfiniteBlades.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Infinite Blades'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Infinite Blades}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, add X {{C|Shiv|Shivs}} into your hand.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n|-\n|[[File:Icon NextTurnBlock.png|frameless|60x60px|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Next Turn Block'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Dodge and Roll}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{R|Self-Forming Clay}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|Gain X {{KW|Block}} next turn.\n|\n|Intensity\n|Integer limit\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Nightmare.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Nightmare'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Nightmare}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Add 3 of a chosen card into your hand next turn.\n| \n* Copies won\u2019t keep temporary costs unless rolled by Snecko Eye / Setup / Forethought.\n* Internally called Night_Terror.\n| Creates separate stacks for each use\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_NoxiousFumes.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Noxious Fumes'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Noxious Fumes}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, apply X {{BD|Poison}} to ALL enemies.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Phantasmal.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Phantasmal'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Phantasmal Killer}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Deal double damage for the next X turns.\n| \n* Grants the {{BD|Double Damage}} buff each turn.\n| Duration\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_ThousandCuts.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Thousand Cuts'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|A Thousand Cuts}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you play a card, deal X damage to ALL enemies.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Tools.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Tools of the Trade'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Tools of the Trade}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, draw X cards and discard X cards.\n| Triggers before {{C|Mayhem}}, regardless of order played.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Equilibrium.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Well-Laid Plans'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Well-Laid Plans}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the end of your turn, Retain up to X cards.\n| Works with {{C|Establishment}}.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Amplify.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Amplify'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Amplify}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Your next X Power cards are played twice.\n|\n| Counter\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_CreativeAI.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Creative AI'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Creative AI}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, add X random Power cards into your hand.\n| The extra Powers will immediately go to your Discard Pile.\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_DrawCard.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Draw'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Machine Learning}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, draw X additional cards.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_EchoForm.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Echo Form'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Echo Form}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| The first X cards you play each turn are played twice.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Electro.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Electro'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Electrodynamics}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| {{KW|Lightning}} hits ALL enemies.\n|\n| Does not stack\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Equilibrium.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Equilibrium'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Equilibrium}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Retain your hand for X turns.\n|\n| Duration\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Heatsink.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Heatsink'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Heatsinks}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you play a Power card, draw X cards.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Hello.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Hello'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Hello World}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, add X random Common cards into your hand.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Loop.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Loop'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Loop}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, trigger the passive ability of your next Orb X times.\n| Does not trigger extra times with {{R|Gold-Plated Cables}}. Triggers before {{BD|Bias|Bias'}} negative {{BD|Focus}} takes effect.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Rebound.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Rebound'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Rebound}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| The next X cards you play this turn are placed on top of your draw pile.\n| Despite being technically stackable, there\u2019s no way to stack {{BD|Rebound}} in basegame.\n| Counter\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Repair.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Repair'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Self Repair}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the end of combat, heal X HP.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_StaticDischarge.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Static Discharge'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Static Discharge}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you receive attack damage, channel X {{KW|Lightning}}.\n| Only cares about unblocked attack damage; won\u2019t trigger if damage is fully negated by {{BD|Buffer}} / {{BD|Strength Down}} / {{BD|Weak}}, but will trigger if reduced to 0 by {{R|Tungsten Rod}}.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Storm.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Storm'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Storm}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you play a Power card, channel X {{KW|Lightning}}.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_BattleHymn.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Battle Hymn'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Battle Hymn}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, add X {{C|Smite|Smites}} to your hand.\n| \n* The {{C|Smite|Smites}} go to your Discard Pile immediately.\n* Will be triggered by {{C|Vault}}.\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Blasphemer.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Blasphemer'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Blasphemy}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, die.\n| \n* Debuff coded as a buff to prevent {{BD|Artifact}} / {{R|Orange Pellets}} from overriding it.<br>\n* Deals 99999 HP loss; can be prevented with enough max HP, {{BD|Buffer}}, and {{BD|Intangible}} active; consumes Lizard Tail / Fairy in a Bottle.<br>\n** HP loss means even if {{BD|Intangible}} reduces it to 1, it can\u2019t be blocked.<br>\n* Triggered by {{C|Vault}}.<br>\n* Internally called EndTurnDeath.\n| Does not stack\n| n/a\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_EnergizedBlue.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Collect'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Collect}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your next X turns, put a {{C|Miracle|Miracle+}} in your hand.\n|\n| Duration\n| 1 to 999\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_DevaForm.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Deva'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Deva Form}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn gain {{Icon|PE}} N times and increase this gain by X.\n| \n* X = number of Deva Forms played. Initially N = X; each turn N increases by X. Further plays increase both N and X by 1.\n* Triggered by {{C|Vault}}.\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit, but will not gain more than 999 Energy\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Devotion.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Devotion'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Devotion}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, gain X {{BD|Mantra}}.\n| \n* Internally called DevotionPower.<br>\n* Triggered by {{C|Vault}}.<br>\n* If you have more than 10 Devotion and 0 {{BD|Mantra}} before it triggers, it will trigger Divinity but not stack for Brilliance.\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Establishment.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Establishment'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Establishment}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever a card is Retained, lower its cost by X.\n| Internally called EstablishmentPower.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Foresight.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Foresight'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Foresight}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, Scry X.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_FreeAttackPower.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Free Attack Power'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Swivel}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Ignore energy costs on the next X Attacks you play.\n| Doesn\u2019t work with All for One / Scrape; works with X-cost cards (you still pay current energy cost).\n| Counter\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_LikeWater.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Like Water'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Like Water}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the end of your turn, if you are in Calm, gain X {{KW|Block}}.\n| Internally called LikeWaterPower.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_MasterReality.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Master Reality'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Master Reality}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever a card is created during combat, Upgrade it.\n|\n| Does not stack\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_MentalFortress.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Mental Fortress'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Mental Fortress}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you switch Stances, gain X {{KW|Block}}.\n| Internally called Controlled. Triggers before Beat of Death, except for Simmering Fury.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Nirvana.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Nirvana'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Nirvana}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you Scry, gain X {{KW|Block}}.\n| Will trigger even if you Scry on an empty Draw Pile, unlike Weave.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Omega.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Omega'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Omega}} (by {{C|Alpha}})</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the end of your turn, deal X damage to ALL enemies.\n| Internally called OmegaPower.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Rushdown.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Rushdown'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Rushdown}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you enter Wrath, draw X cards.\n| Internally called Adaptation.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Anger.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Simmering Rage'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Simmering Fury}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Enter Wrath at the start of your turn.\n| Internally called WrathNextTurnPower.\n| Does not stack\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Study.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Study'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Study}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the end of your turn, shuffle X Insights into your draw pile.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit, but not recommended (can crash if too large)\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Wave.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Wave of the Hand'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Wave of the Hand}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you gain {{KW|Block}}, apply X {{BD|Weak}} to ALL enemies.\n| Internally called WaveOfTheHandPower; lasts 1 turn, but persists across {{C|Vault|Vaulted}} turn.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Magnetism.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Magnetism'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|Magnetism}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, add X random Colorless cards into your hand.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Mayhem.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Mayhem'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|Mayhem}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the start of your turn, play the top X card of your draw pile.\n| Triggers after {{C|Tools of the Trade}} fully resolves, regardless of order played.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Panache.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Panache'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|Panache}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| If you play [counter] more cards this turn, deal X damage to all enemies.\n| Counter starts at 5, decreases by 1 per card; at 0 it deals damage and resets to 5. Extra stacks increase damage. If Panache is last before 0, the extra stack does NOT count for current damage.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Sadistic.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Sadistic'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|Sadistic Nature}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you apply a debuff to an enemy, deal X damage.\n|\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Bomb.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''The Bomb'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|The Bomb}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the end of N turns, deal 40(50) damage to all enemies.\n| N starts at 3, ticks down to 1.\n| Creates separate stacks for each use\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Anger.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Angry'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Mad Gremlin}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Upon receiving attack damage, gains X {{BD|Strength}}.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_BackAttack.png|60px|middle|center]] [[File:Icon_BackAttack2.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Back Attack'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Spire Shield}} and {{M|Spire Spear}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Deals 50% more damage as it is attacking you from behind.\n|\n| Does not stack\n| 1\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_BeatOfDeath.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Beat of Death'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Corrupt Heart}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you play a card, take X damage.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Curiosity.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Curiosity'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Awakened One}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you play a Power card, gains X {{BD|Strength}}.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_CurlUp.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Curl Up'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Red Louse}} and {{M|Green Louse}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| On receiving attack damage, rolls up and gains X {{KW|Block}}.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Anger.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Enrage'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Gremlin Nob}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you play a Skill, gains X {{BD|Strength}}.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Explosive.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Explosive'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Exploder}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Explodes in some amount of turns, dealing X damage.\n| Explodes after 3 turns.\n| Special\n| Unknown\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Fading.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Fading'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Transient}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Dies in X turns.\n|\n| Duration\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Flying.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Flying'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Byrd}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Takes 50% less damage from the next X attacks. Removed when attacked X times in one turn. Resets charges at the start of next turn if not fully removed.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Invincible.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Invincible'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Corrupt Heart}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Can only lose X more HP this turn.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_LifeLink.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Life Link'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Darkling}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| If other {{M|Darkling|Darklings}} are still alive, revives in 2 turns.\n|\n| Does not stack\n| 1\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Malleable.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Malleable'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Snake Plant}} and {{M|Writhing Mass}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Upon receiving attack damage, gains X {{KW|Block}}. {{KW|Block}} gain increases as '''Malleable''' triggers. Resets to X at the start of your turn.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Minion.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''[[Minion]]'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">[[Gremlins]] from {{M|Gremlin Leader}}, {{M|Bronze Orb}},  {{M|Torch Head}}, {{M|Dagger}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Minions abandon combat without their leader.\n|\n| Does not stack\n| 1\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_ModeShift.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Mode Shift'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|The Guardian}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| After receiving X damage, changes to a defensive mode.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_PainfulStabs.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Painful Stabs'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Corrupt Heart}} and {{M|Book of Stabbing}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you receive attack damage from this enemy, add X {{C|Wound|Wounds}} into your discard pile.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Reactive.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Reactive'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Writhing Mass}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Upon receiving attack damage, it changes its [[Intent]].\n|\n| Does not stack\n| 1\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Regen.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Regenerate'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Awakened One}}, [[Elites#Super_Elites|Super Elites]], {{R|Ancient Augmentation}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the end of its turn, heals X HP.\n| Does not decay at end of turn.\n| Intensity\n|\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_SharpHide.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Sharp Hide'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|The Guardian}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you play an {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Attack|Attack}}, take X damage.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Shifting.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Shifting'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Transient}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Upon lose HP, loses that much {{BD|Strength}} until the end of the turn.\n|\n| Does not stack\n| 1\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Split.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Split'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Acid Slime (L)}}, {{M|Spike Slime (L)}}, and {{M|Slime Boss}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| When its HP is at or below 50%, it will split into 2 smaller [[Slimes]] with its current HP.\n|\n| Does not stack\n| 1\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_SporeCloud.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Spore Clouds'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Fungi Beast}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| On death, applies X {{BD|Vulnerable}}.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Stasis.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Stasis'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Bronze Orb}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| On death, a stolen card is returned to your hand.\n|\n| Does not stack\n| 1\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_StrengthUp.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Strength Up'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Orb Walker}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| At the end of its turn, it gains X {{BD|Strength}}.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Thievery.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Thievery'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Looter}} and {{M|Mugger}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Steals X [[Gold]] whenever it attacks.\n|\n| Intensity\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_TimeWarp.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Time Warp'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Time Eater}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Whenever you play some amount of cards, your turn ends and it gains 2 {{BD|Strength}}.\n| Playing 12 cards triggers this.\n| Counter\n| Unknown\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Unawakened.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Unawakened'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Awakened One}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| This enemy hasn't awakened yet...\n| This is not foreshadowing at all.\n| Does not stack\n| Integer limit\n\n|-\n| [[File:Icon_Surrounded.png|60px|middle|center]]\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n'''Surrounded'''\n|\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{M|Spire Shield}} and {{M|Spire Spear}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n| Receive 50% more damage if attacked from behind.\n|\nUse targeting cards or potions to change your orientation.<br>\nRounding error from Surrounded can cause these enemies to deal slightly less damage than the intent shows, on specific damage numbers.\n| Does not stack\n|\n|}\n\n__FORCETOC____noeditsection__\n\n[[Category: Game Mechanics]]\n[[Category: ToUpdate]]"}}}]},"1517":{"pageid":1517,"ns":0,"title":"Debuffs","revisions":[{"revid":56145,"parentid":55732,"slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","*":"{{Sequel Disambiguation}}\n{{Template:Under Construction}}\n{{#setmainimage:Intent_Debuff.png|quiet}}\n{{TOC limit|2}}\nSee also: [[Buffs]]\n\n== Stack Types ==\n{{Hatnote|'''Note:''' These terms are not officially used by the game and are used by the wiki for better classification and description of their behavior.}}\n* '''Intensity Debuffs''' are more effective depending on how many stacks of the debuffs you have. These debuffs typically are either permanent for the combat encounter or are consumed on the following turn.\n* '''Duration Debuffs''' last for as many turns as you have stacks of the debuff.\n* '''Counter Debuffs''' activate when an event happens, such as playing a card.\n\n{{BD|Poison}} is the ONLY Debuff with both '''Intensity''' and '''Duration''' stack types.\n\n== Counter ==\n* {{R|Orange Pellets}} can cleanse the player of all debuffs.\n* {{BD|Artifact}} negates the application of the next debuff received.\n** Gaining {{BD|Artifact}} does not interact with existing debuffs on the character.\n\n== Debuffs List ==\nDebuffs that can be found in multiple sources in the game.\n\n<div id=\"character-filters\"></div>\n{| class=\"wikitable sortable\" id=\"characterTable\" data-filter-label=\"Applied By\"\n!Icon\n! style=\"width: 7em;\" | Name\n! style=\"width: 20em;\" | Source to Target\n! style=\"width: 12em;\" | Source to Self\n! Description\n! Notes\n! Stacking type\n! Caps at\n|-\n|<div id=\"Vulnerable\">[[File:Icon Vulnerable.png|frameless|60x60px]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== [[Vulnerable]] ======\n|<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Bash}}, {{C|Thunderclap}}, {{C|Uppercut}}, {{C|Shockwave}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Terror}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Beam Cell}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Crush Joints}}, {{C|Indignation}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|Trip}}, {{R|Bag of Marbles}}, {{R|Hand Drill}}, {{P|Fear Potion}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Chosen}}, {{M|Gremlin Nob}}, {{M|Red Slaver}}, {{M|Snecko}}, {{M|Writhing Mass}}, {{M|The Champ}}, {{M|The Collector}}, {{M|Corrupt Heart}}, {{M|The Guardian}}, {{M|Time Eater}}</span>\n|<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Berserk}}</span>\n|Receive 50% ({{R|Odd Mushroom|25%}}) ({{R|Paper Phrog|75%}}) more damage from Attacks for X turns.\n|\n* Applied after {{BD|Strength}} and {{BD|Vigor}}, then final damage rounds down. \n* Effect can be reduced to +25% extra damage with {{R|Odd Mushroom}}.\n|Duration\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Weak\">[[File:Icon Weak.png|frameless|60x60px]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== [[Weak]] ======\n|<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Clothesline}}, {{C|Intimidate}}, {{C|Shockwave}}, {{C|Uppercut}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Crippling Cloud}}, {{C|Leg Sweep}}, {{C|Malaise}}, {{C|Neutralize}}, {{C|Sucker Punch}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Go for the Eyes}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Sash Whip}}, {{C|Wave of the Hand}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|Blind}}, {{R|Red Mask}}, {{R|Champion Belt}}, {{P|Weak Potion}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Acid Slime (L)}}, {{M|Acid Slime (M)}}, {{M|Acid Slime (S)}}, {{M|Blue Slaver}}, {{M|Chosen}}, {{M|Fat Gremlin}}, {{M|Giant Head}}, {{M|Green Louse}}, {{M|The Maw}}, {{M|Reptomancer}}, {{M|Romeo}}, {{M|Snake Plant}}, {{M|Snecko}}, {{M|Writhing Mass}}, {{M|The Champ}}, {{M|The Collector}}, {{M|Corrupt Heart}}, {{M|The Guardian}}, {{M|Time Eater}}</span>\n|<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|Doubt}}, {{R|Gremlin Visage}}</span>\n|Attacks deal 25% ({{R|Paper Krane|40%}}) less damage for X turns.\n|\n* Applied after {{BD|Strength}} and {{BD|Vigor}}, then final damage rounds down. \n* Specifically negated by {{R|Ginger}}.\n|Duration\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Frail\">[[File:Icon Frail.png|frameless|60x60px]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Frail ======\n|<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Fat Gremlin}}, {{M|The Maw}}, {{M|Mystic}}, {{M|Shelled Parasite}}, {{M|Snake Plant}}, {{M|Spheric Guardian}}, {{M|Spike Slime (L)}}, {{M|Spike Slime (M)}}</span>\n|<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|Shame}}</span>\n|Gain 25% less Block from cards for X turns.\n|\n* Applied after {{BD|Dexterity}}, then final {{KW|Block}} rounds down. \n* Specifically negated by {{R|Turnip}}.\n* Shares its affected cards with {{BD|Dexterity}}, rules can be view at [[Dexterity#Interactions]]\n|Duration\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Poison\">[[File:Icon Poison.png|frameless|60x60px]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== [[Poison]] ======\n|<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Deadly Poison}}, {{C|Poisoned Stab}}, {{C|Bouncing Flask}}, {{C|Crippling Cloud}}, {{C|Corpse Explosion}}, {{C|Noxious Fumes}}, {{C|Envenom}}, {{C|Catalyst}}</span>\n{{R|Snecko Skull}}, {{R|The Specimen}}, {{R|Twisted Funnel}}, {{P|Poison Potion}}\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|\n|At the start of its turn, lose X HP, then reduce Poison by 1.\n|{{C|Catalyst}} counts as a single application for {{R|Snecko Skull}} and {{BD|Artifact}} interactions.\n(only 9999 Poison can be applied as a single instance. This is only relevant to Specimen and having more than 9999 stacks of Noxious Fumes in the base game. This is NOT relevant to Catalyst.)\n|Intensity and Duration\n|Integer limit \n|-\n|<div id=\"Strength Down\">[[File:Icon StrengthDown.png|frameless|60x60px]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== [[Strength]] Down ======\n|\n|<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Flex}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{R|Mutagenic Strength}}, {{P|Flex Potion}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|At the end of this turn, lose X Strength.\n|Internally called Flex.\n|Intensity\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Strength (Negative)\">[[File:Icon Strength.png|frameless|60x60px]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== [[Strength]] (Negative) ======\n|<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Disarm}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Piercing Wail}}, {{C|Malaise}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|Dark Shackles}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Lagavulin}}, {{M|Spire Shield}}</span>\n|<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{BD|Shifting}}</span>\n| Decreases attack damage by X.\n| All negative {{BD|Strength}} can be cleansed with {{R|Orange Pellets}}, resetting it to 0. {{BD|Artifact}} can negate 1 instance of negative Strength.\n<span data-text=\"ironclad\">No ordering of Orange Pellets and healing can negate the -3 {{BD|Strength}} inflicted by going above half hp for {{R|Red Skull}}, however Artifact can.</span>\n|Intensity\n| -999 to -1\n|-\n|<div id=\"Shackled\">[[File:Icon Shackled.png|frameless|60x60px]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Shackled ======\n|<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Piercing Wail}}</span> <span data-text=\"all\">{{C|Dark Shackles}}</span>\n|<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{BD|Shifting}}</span>\n|At the end of its turn, gains X Strength.\n|Buff coded as a debuff. As a result, using {{C|Piercing Wail}} or {{C|Dark Shackles}} on the turn the [[Corrupt Heart]] cleanses negative {{BD|Strength}} will cause it to gain X {{BD|Strength}}. And using them on the turn [[Time Eater]], [[Awakened One]] and [[The Champ]] removes debuffs, makes the strength loss permanent.\nPlaying {{C|Piercing Wail}} or {{C|Dark Shackles}} on an Enemy with {{BD|Artifact}} will cause it to only lose 1 {{BD|Artifact}}, despite being 2 Debuffs. \n|Intensity\n|0 to 999\n|-\n|<div id=\"Dexterity Down\">[[File:Icon StrengthDown.png|frameless|60x60px]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== [[Dexterity]] Down ======\n|\n|<span data-text=\"all\">{{P|Speed Potion}}, {{R|Duality}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|At the end of your turn, lose X Dexterity.\n|\n|Intensity\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Dexterity (Negative)\">[[File:Icon Dexterity.png|frameless|60x60px]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== [[Dexterity]] (Negative) ======\n|<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Lagavulin}}</span>\n|<span data-text=\"silent\">{{BD|Wraith Form}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|Decreases Block gained from cards by X.\n|Negative {{BD|Dexterity}} can be cleansed by {{R|Orange Pellets}}, resetting it to 0. {{BD|Artifact}} can negate 1 instance of negative Dexterity\n|Intensity\n| -999 to -1\n|-\n|<div id=\"Focus (Negative)\">[[File:Icon Focus.png|frameless|60x60px]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== [[Focus]] (Negative) ======\n|<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Spire Shield}}</span>\n|<span data-text=\"defect\">{{BD|Bias}}, {{C|Reprogram}}, {{C|Hyperbeam}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|Decreases effectiveness of Orbs by X.\n|Negative {{BD|Focus}} can be cleansed with {{R|Orange Pellets}}, resetting it to 0. {{BD|Artifact}} can negate 1 instance of negative Focus.\n* {{M|Spire Shield}} only has a chance of applying if Player has an [[Orb]] Slot.\n|Intensity\n| -999 to -1\n|-\n|<div id=\"Confusion\">[[File:Icon_Confusion.png|frameless|60px]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Confusion ======\n|<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Snecko}}</span>\n|<span data-text=\"all\">{{R|Snecko Eye}}</span>\n|Whenever you draw a card, randomize its cost.\n|Only drawing into the card changes its cost (0\u20133). Fetching it with effects like {{C|Seek}} keeps its current cost.\n<span data-text=\"all\">{{BD|Confused|Confusion}} from {{R|Snecko Eye}} is applied at the start of combat and cannot negated by any {{BD|Artifact}}, including from {{R|Clockwork Souvenir}}.</span>\n|Doesn't stack\n|1\n|-\n|<div id=\"Choked\">[[File:Icon_Choked.png|60px|middle]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Choked ======\n|<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Choke}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|\n|Whenever you play a card this turn, the targeted enemy loses X HP.\n|\n|Intensity\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Corpse Explosion\">[[File:Icon_CorpseExplosion.png|60px|middle]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Corpse Explosion ======\n|<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Corpse Explosion}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|\n|On death, the enemy deals X times its Max HP worth of damage to ALL other enemies.\n|\n|Intensity\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"No Draw\">[[File:Icon_NoDraw.png|frameless|60px]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== No Draw ======\n|\n|<span data-text=\"ironclad\">{{C|Battle Trance}}</span>\n<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Bullet Time}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"ironclad silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|You cannot draw cards this turn.\n|\n|Doesn't stack\n|1\n|-\n|<div id=\"Wraith Form\">[[File:Icon_WraithForm.png|60px|middle]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Wraith Form ======\n|\n|<span data-text=\"silent\">{{C|Wraith Form}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"silent\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|Lose X {{BD|Dexterity}} at the start of your turn.\n|\n|Intensity\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Bias\">[[File:Icon_Bias.png|60px|middle]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Bias ======\n|\n|<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Biased Cognition}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|At the start of your turn, lose X {{BD|Focus}}.\n|\n|Intensity\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Lock-On\">[[File:Icon_LockOn.png|60px|middle]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Lock-On ======\n|<span data-text=\"defect\">{{C|Bullseye}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"defect\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|\n|{{KW|Lightning}} and {{KW|Dark}} Orbs deal 50% more damage to this enemy.\n|\n|Duration\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Block Return\">[[File:Icon_BlockReturn.png|60px|middle]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Block Return ======\n|<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Talk to the Hand}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|\n|Whenever you attack this enemy, gain X {{KW|Block}}.\n|\n|Intensity\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Fasting\">[[File:Icon_Fasting.png|60px|middle]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Fasting ======\n|\n|<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Fasting}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|Gain X less {{KW|Energy}} at the start of each turn.\n|\n|Intensity\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Mark\">[[File:Icon_Mark.png|60px|middle]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Mark ======\n|<span data-text=\"watcher\">{{C|Pressure Points}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"watcher\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|\n|Whenever you play {{C|Pressure Points}}, all enemies with '''Mark''' lose X HP.\n|\n|Intensity\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"No Block\">[[File:Icon_NoBlock.png|60px|middle]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== No Block ======\n|\n|<span data-text=\"all\">{{C|Panic Button}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"all\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|You cannot gain {{KW|Block}} from cards for the next X turns.\n|\n|Duration\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Constricted\">[[File:Icon_Constricted.png|60px|middle]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Constricted ======\n|<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Spire Growth}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|\n|At the end of your turn, take X damage.\n|\n|Intensity\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Draw Reduction\">[[File:Icon_DrawReduction.png|60px|middle]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Draw Reduction ======\n|<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Time Eater}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|\n|Draw 1 less card for the next X turns.\n|\n|Duration\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Entangled\">[[File:Icon_Entangled.png|60px|middle]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Entangled ======\n|<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Red Slaver}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|\n|You may not play {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Attack|Attacks}} this turn.\n|\n|Does not stack\n|1\n|-\n|<div id=\"Hex\">[[File:Icon_Hex.png|60px|middle]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Hex ======\n|<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{M|Chosen}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|\n|Whenever you play a non-{{QueryLink|Cards|type:Attack|Attack}} card, add X {{C|Dazed}} to your draw pile.\n|\n|Intensity\n|Integer limit\n|-\n|<div id=\"Slow\">[[File:Icon Slow.png|frameless|60x60px]]</div>\n| style=\"text-align:center; font-weight:bold;\" |\n====== Slow ======\n|\n|<span data-text=\"enemy\">{{KW|Time Dilation}}{{M|Giant Head}}</span>\n<span data-show=\"enemy\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n|Whenever you play a card, the target receives 10% more damage from Attacks this turn.\n|X is carried over on the continued turn after Vault is played. While it caps at the integer limit,\tthe attack damage overflows to -1 long before Slow reaches it. This -1 damage deals no damage.\n|Intensity\n|Integer limit\n|}\n\n__FORCETOC____noeditsection__\n\n[[Category: Game Mechanics]]"}}}]},"3189":{"pageid":3189,"ns":0,"title":"Dexterity","revisions":[{"revid":55740,"parentid":54193,"slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","*":"{{Sequel Disambiguation}}\n{{Power Infobox\n|Name         = Dexterity\n|Image        = Icon Dexterity.png\n|Description  = Increase {{KW|Block}} gained from cards by X.\n|Type         = Buff\n|Stacks       = Intensity\n|BetweenTurns = \n|Cap          = \n}}\n{{BD|Dexterity}} is a [[Buff]] that increases the amount of {{KW|Block}} you gain from cards. This '''does not''' apply to any other sources of {{KW|Block}}, only cards.\n\n{{BD|Dexterity}} can be negative, reducing the {{KW|Block}} gained from cards to a minimum of 0.\n\n== Sources ==\n=== On Player ===\n==== Cards ====\n* {{C|Footwork}}: Gain 2({{TS|green||3}}) {{BD|Dexterity}}.\n* {{C|Reprogram}}: Lose 1 {{BD|Focus}}. Gain 1({{TS|green||2}}) {{BD|Strength}}. Gain 1({{TS|green||2}}) {{BD|Dexterity}}.\n* {{C|Wraith Form}}: Gain 2({{TS|green||3}}) {{BD|Intangible}}. At the end of your turn, lose 1 {{BD|Dexterity}}.\n** Applies the {{BD|Wraith Form}} debuff.\n\n==== Relics ====\n* {{R|Kunai}}: Every time you play 3 {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Attack|Attacks}} in a single turn, gain 1 {{BD|Dexterity}}.\n* {{R|Oddly Smooth Stone}}: At the start of each combat, gain 1 {{BD|Dexterity}}.\n* {{R|Duality}}: Whenever you play an {{QueryLink|Cards|type:Attack|Attack}}, gain 1 temporary {{BD|Dexterity}}.\n** Also applies the {{BD|Dexterity Down}} debuff.\n\n==== Potions ====\n* {{P|Dexterity Potion}}: Gain 2(4 with {{R|Sacred Bark}}) {{BD|Dexterity}}.\n* {{P|Speed Potion}}: Gain 5(10 with {{R|Sacred Bark}}) {{BD|Dexterity}}. At the end of your turn, lose 5(10 with {{R|Sacred Bark}}) {{BD|Dexterity}}.\n** Applies the {{BD|Dexterity Down}} debuff.\n\n==== Monsters ====\n<!-- Make consistent with the descriptions in the Enemies database. Hover over the intent templates to see them. -->\n* {{M|Lagavulin}}\n** {{Int|Lagavulin|Siphon Soul}} - Player {{TS|negative||loses}} 1 ({{Asc|19|2}}) {{BD|Dexterity}}.\n\n== Interactions ==\n* Dexterity Does not affect block gained from [[Relics]] and {{KW|Frost}} Orbs.\n* Dexterity does not affect block gained from Buffs or Debuffs, including those gained by {{C|Metallicize}}, {{C|Rage}}, {{C|Talk to the Hand}}, and {{C|After Image}}.\n* Dexterity Does not affect block gained from {{C|Entrench}} or {{C|Wallop}}.\n* {{C|Dodge and Roll}}'s {{BD|Next Turn Block}} depends on current turn effects, so if {{C|Dodge and Roll}} (at 0 {{BD|Dexterity}}) is played this turn and {{BD|Dexterity}} goes negative, the player will still gain 4 {{KW|Block}} next turn.\n* Negative {{BD|Dexterity}} is treated as a debuff, so it can be removed with {{BD|Artifact}} or {{R|Orange Pellets}}.\n=== Making temporary Dexterity permanent ===\n{{Power Infobox|Dexterity Down}}\n* Temporary sources of {{BD|Dexterity}} like {{R|Duality}} and {{P|Speed Potion}} work by giving you {{BD|Dexterity}} plus an equal amount of {{BD|Dexterity Down}}. Since it is a [[Debuff]], you can use {{BD|Artifact}} or {{R|Orange Pellets}} to remove it, keeping the gained {{BD|Dexterity}} permanently.\n\n[[Category:ToUpdate]]\n[[Category:Game Mechanics]]"}}}]},"1976":{"pageid":1976,"ns":0,"title":"Focus","revisions":[{"revid":4064,"parentid":0,"slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","*":"#REDIRECT [[Orbs#Focus]]"}}}]},"2577":{"pageid":2577,"ns":0,"title":"Minion","revisions":[{"revid":7333,"parentid":0,"slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","*":"#REDIRECT [[Minions]]"}}}]}}}}